{"seq":3,"slug":"polyphase-power-system","title":"多相输配电系统：现代电网的技术蓝图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/polyphase-ac-system/polyphase-power-system","wordCount":1620,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"多相输配电系统-现代电网的技术蓝图\">多相输配电系统：现代电网的技术蓝图</h1><p>特斯拉真正改变世界的，不只是一台电动机，而是一整套从发电、升压、远距离输送、降压到用电的完整系统。1887 年底到 1888 年初，他一口气申请了七项美国专利，覆盖了交流发电机、变压器、输电线路与电动机——这不是单点发明，而是一份完整的电力工业蓝图。正是这套多相系统，让&quot;在尼亚加拉发电、把电送到几十公里外的水牛城&quot;成为可能，并最终在与爱迪生直流体系的&quot;电流之战&quot;中取得决定性胜利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多相输配电系统的核心逻辑是分工：用高电压解决远距离输送的损耗问题，用低电压解决用户端的安全问题，再用变压器在两者之间自由转换。直流体系做不到这种自由转换，所以受制于&quot;发电站必须靠近用户&quot;的硬约束；交流多相系统则彻底松绑了这一约束。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  G[三相交流发电机] --&gt; SU[升压变压器]&#10;  SU --&gt; TL[高压输电线路]&#10;  TL --&gt; SD[降压变压器]&#10;  SD --&gt; D[配电网]&#10;  D --&gt; L[感应电动机与照明负载]\">flowchart LR\n  G[三相交流发电机] --&gt; SU[升压变压器]\n  SU --&gt; TL[高压输电线路]\n  TL --&gt; SD[降压变压器]\n  SD --&gt; D[配电网]\n  D --&gt; L[感应电动机与照明负载]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>电压水平</th>\n<th>解决的核心问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发电</td>\n<td>中等电压</td>\n<td>由水力或燃料驱动发电机产生三相交流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升压</td>\n<td>很高电压</td>\n<td>降低线路电流，从而减小输电损耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输送</td>\n<td>很高电压</td>\n<td>把电能送往几十至上百公里外</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降压</td>\n<td>低电压</td>\n<td>转换为用户端安全可用的电压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用电</td>\n<td>低电压</td>\n<td>驱动电动机、照明等终端设备</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为何升压能减少损耗\">为何升压能减少损耗</h2><p>整套系统的经济性基础，是一条简单却威力巨大的物理规律。对于给定的传输功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = U I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，导线上的损耗功率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{loss}} = I^2 R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是线路电流，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是导线电阻。把功率表达式中的电流代入，可得</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>U</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><msup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{loss}} = \\left(\\frac{P}{U}\\right)^2 R = \\frac{P^2 R}{U^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式说明：在传输同样功率时，线路损耗与电压的平方成反比。把输电电压提高到原来的 10 倍，线路损耗就降到原来的百分之一。这正是远距离输电必须升压的根本原因，也是交流体系相对直流体系的决定性优势——因为只有交流电才能用变压器方便、高效地升降压。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三相为何胜过单相与两相\">三相为何胜过单相与两相</h2><p>特斯拉最初的系统是两相的，但电力工业最终统一到三相。三相系统的优势是综合性的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导线利用率高：传输同样功率，三相系统所需导线总截面比单相系统更省</li>\n<li>功率平稳：三相负载的瞬时总功率是恒定的，不像单相那样以两倍频率脉动，这让发电机和电动机运转更平稳</li>\n<li>旋转磁场天然形成：三相绕组直接产生恒幅旋转磁场，完美匹配感应电动机</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可以用数学说明三相功率的平稳性。三相对称负载的瞬时总功率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(t) = u_a i_a + u_b i_b + u_c i_c = \\frac{3}{2} U_m I_m \\cos\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>结果是一个不含时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的常数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span> 为功率因数角）。瞬时功率恒定意味着没有转矩脉动，这对大型发电机和电动机的机械稳定性至关重要。正因如此，三相成为全球电网沿用至今的标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电流之战与威斯汀豪斯的商业化\">电流之战与威斯汀豪斯的商业化</h2><p>技术上的优越并不自动等于胜利。1880 年代末到 1890 年代初，爱迪生阵营与威斯汀豪斯-特斯拉阵营之间爆发了著名的&quot;电流之战&quot;（War of the Currents）。爱迪生通过公开电死动物等手段渲染交流电的危险，试图阻止其推广。</p>\n<p>转折点接连到来：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1888 年 7 月，威斯汀豪斯买下特斯拉的交流专利并聘他为顾问，把旋转磁场原理转化为可销售的产品</li>\n<li>1893 年，威斯汀豪斯以交流系统中标芝加哥世界博览会照明工程，向公众证明了交流电的安全与可靠</li>\n<li>1893 年，威斯汀豪斯-特斯拉团队获得尼亚加拉瀑布水电站的建设合同，1896 年 11 月正式向水牛城送电</li>\n</ul>\n<p>到世纪之交，交流多相系统已成为电力工业不可逆转的主流，直流体系退守到电解、电镀等少数特殊场合。特斯拉的这套蓝图就此奠定了此后一百多年全球电网的基本架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代电网中的遗产\">现代电网中的遗产</h2><p>今天的超高压、特高压输电网，在原理上仍是特斯拉多相系统的直接延续——发电、升压、远距离输送、降压、配电的五段式结构毫无改变。变化主要发生在规模和器件层面：电压从当年的几万伏提升到上百万伏，变压器和发电机的容量增长了几个数量级，电力电子器件让电网的调度与控制远比当年精细。</p>\n<p>值得一提的是，进入二十一世纪后，高压直流输电（HVDC）在跨海、超远距离场合重新登场，似乎是直流的&quot;复仇&quot;。但这恰恰建立在交流体系之上：HVDC 通过电力电子换流站把交流升压、整流为直流远送，再到对端逆变回交流并入电网。换言之，现代电网是以特斯拉的三相交流系统为主干、辅以直流远送通道的混合体。理解了多相系统，就理解了支撑现代文明运转的那张巨网的来历。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多相输配电系统是发电、升压、输送、降压、用电的完整五段式蓝图，特斯拉于 1887—1888 年以七项专利一举奠定</li>\n<li>升压输电的根本依据是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{loss}} = P^2 R / U^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：损耗与电压平方成反比，而只有交流能方便升降压</li>\n<li>三相系统在导线利用率、功率平稳性和旋转磁场生成上全面胜出，成为全球电网标准</li>\n<li>经由威斯汀豪斯商业化并赢得&quot;电流之战&quot;，这套系统成为现代电网的技术骨架，沿用至今逾一个世纪</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多相输配电系统：现代电网的技术蓝图","id":"多相输配电系统-现代电网的技术蓝图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为何升压能减少损耗","id":"为何升压能减少损耗"},{"level":2,"text":"三相为何胜过单相与两相","id":"三相为何胜过单相与两相"},{"level":2,"text":"电流之战与威斯汀豪斯的商业化","id":"电流之战与威斯汀豪斯的商业化"},{"level":2,"text":"现代电网中的遗产","id":"现代电网中的遗产"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"感应电动机：无需供电转子的可靠动力","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/polyphase-ac-system/induction-motor"},"next":{"title":"特斯拉线圈：谐振升压的高频之源","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/wireless-and-high-frequency/tesla-coil"}}